+/*
+ * Load_skm.cpp
+ * ------------
+ * Purpose: Skale Tracker (SKM) module loader
+ * Notes  : Experimental reference implementation. Compiled, linked, and
+ *          render-tested against OpenMPT; the parsing logic was cross-checked
+ *          against independent C++ and Python reference parsers with exact
+ *          byte consumption.
+ *
+ *          The format was derived only by observing .skm files; no Skale
+ *          binary was disassembled, decompiled, or debugged.
+ *
+ *          VST/VSTi state and Skale's SUB/FX routing graph are not mapped.
+ *          Some 0.76 instruments with 716/784-byte prefixes use an unknown
+ *          keymap encoding and fall back to their first playable sample.
